This repository contains an independent implementation of a method described in:

    Saruggia, A. M. G., & Germano, S. (2026).
    "Predicting Startup Exit from Textual Descriptors:
     A Computational Linguistics Framework."
    arXiv:2608.00045
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.00045
    DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2608.00045

The thresholds, Exit Ratios, Exit Deltas, feature-importance weights, and the
Hyping Score formula restated in startup-framing-screener/references/ are
published results of that study. They are cited here as facts.

This repository is NOT the authors' software and is not endorsed by them.

The marker dictionaries in
startup-framing-screener/references/hyping-markers.md are an independent
reconstruction. The cited study does not publish its dictionaries.

No text, figure, or table from the paper is reproduced verbatim.

